      "ordinal": 1013,
      "headword": "בָּגַד",
      "ref": "BDB, בָּגַד",
      "preview": "בָּגַד: agir perfidamente; paradigma e construções do Qal.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">בָּגַד</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: agir</strong> ou <strong>proceder perfidamente</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּֽגְדָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.20\">Je 3:20</a> + 14 vezes; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְגֹּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:15\" href=\"/Malachi.2.15\">Mal 2:15</a> + 5 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְגַּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:10\" href=\"/Malachi.2.10\">Mal 2:10</a>; infinitivo absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּגוֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.8\">Is 48:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.11\">Je 5:11</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּגֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.1\">Is 33:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְדוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:8\" href=\"/Exodus.21.8\">Ex 21:8</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּגֵד</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.12\">Pr 22:12</a> + 11 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוֹגֵד</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.1\">Is 33:1</a> + 10 vezes—<em>agir</em> ou <em>proceder de maneira pérfida, infiel, enganosa</em>, nas relações conjugais, em questões de propriedade ou de direito, em alianças, na palavra e na conduta em geral. <strong>a.</strong>  uso absoluto <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:33\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.33\">1 S 14:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 6:15\" href=\"/Job.6.15\">Jb 6:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:57\" href=\"/Psalms.78.57\">ψ 78:57</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.16\">Is 24:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.1\">33:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.8\">48:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:11\" href=\"/Malachi.2.11\">Mal 2:11</a>. Cf. as expressões <span dir=\"rtl\">אחי בגדו כמו נחל</span> <em>meus irmãos procederam enganosamente, como um ribeiro</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:15\" href=\"/Job.6.15\">Jb 6:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּגְדִים בָּגָ֑דוּ וּבֶגֶד בּוֹגְדִים בָּגָ֑דוּ</span> <em>os pérfidos procederam perfidamente; sim, com perfídia os pérfidos procederam perfidamente</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.16\">Is 24:16</a> (aliteração marcante); <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּגְדֵי אָוֶן</span> <em>pérfidos na maldade</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:6\" href=\"/Psalms.59.6\">ψ 59:6</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  com <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:8\" href=\"/Exodus.21.8\">Ex 21:8</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:23\" href=\"/Judges.9.23\">Ju 9:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.1\">Is 33:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.20\">Je 3:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.11\">5:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.6\">12:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:2\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.2\">La 1:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:7\" href=\"/Hosea.5.7\">Ho 5:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:7\" href=\"/Hosea.6.7\">6:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:10\" href=\"/Malachi.2.10\">Mal 2:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:14\" href=\"/Malachi.2.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:15\" href=\"/Malachi.2.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:16\" href=\"/Malachi.2.16\">16</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  com acusativo <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:15\" href=\"/Psalms.73.15\">ψ 73:15</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  com <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> em construção pregnante, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּֽגְדָה אִשָּׁה מֵרֵעָהּ</span> <em>procede perfidamente</em> (<em>ao afastar-se</em>) <em>de seu companheiro</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.20\">Je 3:20</a>. O particípio é empregado <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.22\">Pr 2:22</a> + 8 vezes, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 25:3\" href=\"/Psalms.25.3\">ψ 25:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:6\" href=\"/Psalms.59.6\">59:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:158\" href=\"/Psalms.119.158\">119:158</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.2\">Is 21:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.16\">24:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.1\">33:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.8\">Je 3:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.1\">9:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:13\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.13\">Hb 1:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:5\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.5\">2:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּגְדֵי בָ֑גֶד</span> <em>os que agem perfidamente com perfídia</em> (de modo muito <em>pérfido</em>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.1\">Je 12:1</a>.",
